  "content": "<h1>西班牙饗宴</h1><p><img src=\"https://github.com/DevJulen/SpanishDelight-1.20.1-Forge/blob/master/src/main/resources/spanishdelightbanner.png?raw=true\" alt=\"西班牙饗宴\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>西班牙饗宴</strong>是一款基於<strong>農夫樂事</strong>烹飪系統擴展的模組，加入了西班牙傳統料理如西班牙烘蛋、冷湯等美食。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在世界中尋找新食材，烹製美味新料理！</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⚙️ <strong>依賴項目：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝<strong>農夫樂事</strong>與Forge才能運作本模組，強烈建議搭配<strong>JEI</strong>使用！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🧾 <strong>更多資訊：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">未來計畫新增更多食物並推出Fabric版本。若希望此模組支援其他Minecraft版本，歡迎留言建議！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📝 <strong>製作名單：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">開發者：DevJulen</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">特別感謝vectorwing創作農夫樂事 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">特別感謝ArBeet製作素材！ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fArBeeeet\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/ArBeeeet</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌐 <strong>社群平台：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Twitter：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fDevJulen\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/DevJulen</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Instagram：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fdevjulen%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.instagram.com/devjulen</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Itch.io：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdevjulen.itch.io%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://devjulen.itch.io</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
